    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Story\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a\u003c/strong\u003e system user\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want to\u003c/strong\u003e be able to update Reconnection of the power supply\u0027s data\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that\u003c/strong\u003e I will have possibility to correct my mistake\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDesign:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://xd.adobe.com/view/6cb23761-412d-4598-a1c7-08952bed15fb-39e1/\"\u003eReconnection_Of_The_Power_Supply (adobe.com)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp /\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance criteria:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCheck system user permissions to see edit icon on Reconnection of the power supply\u0027s listing/detail page. If no such permission, edit icon will be disabled\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEdit Draft Reconnection of the power supply\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAllows to edit all Reconnection of the power supply\u0027 objects with status Draft\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eEdit Executed Reconnection of the power supply\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eAllows to edit all Reconnection of the power supply\u0027 objects with status Executed\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClicking on an edit icon on listing/detail page will allow edit mode\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll fields are editable with the regular flow if \u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003estatus is Draft\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eFor Executed objects it is possible to edit only:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eFile for import\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eDate of reconnection\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eFiles \u0026ndash; to be able to upload new files or to delete manually uploaded files\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eWhen Draft object is opened for editing the table with PODs should be updated\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eWhen Executed object is opened for editing only selected PODs should be displayed in the table \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eWhen Executed object is opened for editing Save and Cancel buttons should be visible\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen user has created second Reconnection of the power supply object for one Request and its status is Executed, already terminated PODs shouldn\u0027t be displayed in the second Reconnection object\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTask\u0027s\u003c/strong\u003e sub-object should be enable and optional in both flows - when object is Draft or Executed\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClicking on Plus button will open Task\u0027 creation page where Reconnection of the power supply object should be already set as a sub-object\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeparate editing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter creating a Task and clicking on Refresh button, newly created task should be set with the following logic:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTask number-Creation date-Task type\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is possible to click already added record or an arrow and system should open task\u0027s page in new browser window\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is possible to remove already added task from the Reconnection of the power supply object\u0026nbsp; \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSave as a draft\u003c/strong\u003e button (available only is status is Draft)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnable if user has such permission\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisabled if user does not have such permission\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClicking on Save as a draft button will check all the validations (frontend and backend)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf all the validations are successful, then system should save changes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf frontend validations are not successful, system should display an error message with proper field\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf an error happens in backend, system should display an error message retrieved from the backend\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen object is created as a Draft and it is not executed yes, however, user creates identical Reconnection of the power supply object, should display all PODs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSave and Execute\u003c/strong\u003e button (available only is status is Draft)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnable is user has such permission\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisabled if user does not have such permission\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClicking on Save and execute button will check all the validations (frontend and backend)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf all the validations are successful, then system should save changes and change status to Executed\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf frontend validations are not successful, system should display an error message with proper field\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf an error happens in backend, system should display an error message retrieved from the backend\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSystem should generate documents according selected templates and save them in Files\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen user executes the object and created another Reconnection of the power supply object for the same grid operator, should display non-reconnected PODs only\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSave\u003c/strong\u003e button (available only is status is Executed)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEnable if user has such permission\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisabled if user does not have such permission\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClicking on Save button will check all the validations (frontend and backend)\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf frontend validations are not successful, system should display an error message with proper field\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf an error happens in backend, system should display an error message retrieved from the backend\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhen clicking on \u0027\u003cstrong\u003eCancel\u003c/strong\u003e\u0027 or \u0027\u003cstrong\u003eX\u003c/strong\u003e\u0027 button should check changes and if there are changes made then warning pop-up message comes out with buttons: \u0027Your changes are not saved, are you sure you want to cancel?\u0027 Yes/No\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eYes - will close Reconnection of the power supply\u0027s editing page and return to listing page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo - will close warning pop-up and stay on Reconnection of the power supply\u0027s editing page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWarning message should be managed from the system settings\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudit Log record should be created\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e",
